[{"spk": 0, "t0": 11.04, "t1": 15.52, "text": "Are we not allowed to do the lights so people can see that a bit better?", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.841, "margin": 0.467, "clean_s": 4.78, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 18.0, "t1": 19.6, "text": "Yeah. Okay.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": false, "sim": 0.354, "margin": 0.042, "clean_s": 1.9, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 22.48, "t1": 23.44, "text": "Am I supposed to be standing up there?", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.69, "margin": 0.402, "clean_s": 1.26, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 23.12, "t1": 26.88, "text": "standing up there. So we've got both of these clipped on.", "name": null, "verified": false, "sim": 0.624, "margin": 0.037, "clean_s": 4.06, "slot_person": null}, {"spk": 2, "t0": 29.2, "t1": 33.04, "text": "Is she going to answer me? Yeah, good. Right, both of them. Okay.", "name": "FEE016", "verified": true, "sim": 0.542, "margin": 0.313, "clean_s": 4.14, "slot_person": "FEE016"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 29.92, "t1": 30.8, "text": "Yeah. Good.", "name": null, "verified": false, "sim": 0.087, "margin": 0.021, "clean_s": 1.18, "slot_person": null}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 34.4, "t1": 34.96, "text": "yes", "name": null, "verified": false, "sim": 0.0, "margin": 0.0, "clean_s": 0.86, "slot_person": null}, {"spk": 2, "t0": 50.48, "t1": 53.12, "text": "This is gonna fall off, it doesn't let you put it on.", "name": "FEE016", "verified": true, "sim": 0.544, "margin": 0.299, "clean_s": 2.94, "slot_person": "FEE016"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 63.52, "t1": 64.64, "text": "Yep, yep, yep.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": false, "sim": 0.161, "margin": 0.055, "clean_s": 1.42, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 80.64, "t1": 96.0, "text": "Okay, hello everybody. I'm Sarah, the project manager, and this is our first meeting, surprisingly enough. Okay, this is our agenda.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.959, "margin": 0.548, "clean_s": 15.66, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 83.36, "t1": 84.32, "text": "I am.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": false, "sim": 0.364, "margin": 0.023, "clean_s": 1.26, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 96.0, "t1": 110.88, "text": "We will do some stuff, get to know each other a bit better, feel more comfortable with each other. Then we'll go do tool training, talk about the project plan, discuss our own ideas and everything.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.893, "margin": 0.581, "clean_s": 15.18, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 110.88, "t1": 116.24, "text": "and we've got 25 minutes to do that as far as I can understand.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.814, "margin": 0.571, "clean_s": 5.66, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 117.76, "t1": 132.0, "text": "Now we're developing a remote control, which you probably already know. We want it to be original, something that people haven't thought of, that's not out in the shops, trendy, appealing to a wide market.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.872, "margin": 0.542, "clean_s": 14.54, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 132.0, "t1": 141.52, "text": "but not a hunk of metal. And user-friendly, grannies to kids, maybe even poochies, should be able to use it.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.864, "margin": 0.509, "clean_s": 9.82, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 143.12, "t1": 157.44, "text": "Okay, first is the functional design. This is where we all go off and do our individual work. What needs need to be fulfilled by the product? What effect the product has to have? And how it's...", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.908, "margin": 0.503, "clean_s": 14.62, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 157.44, "t1": 168.24, "text": "how it's actually going to do that. Conceptual design, what we're thinking, how it's going to go. And then the detailed design, how we're actually going to put it into practice and make it work.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.873, "margin": 0.53, "clean_s": 11.1, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 170.56, "t1": 184.8, "text": "Okay, right. We're going to practice with the pens and draw our favorite animal on the whiteboard. I'll go first. And sum up the characteristics of that animal. So...", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.865, "margin": 0.403, "clean_s": 14.54, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 189.04, "t1": 193.28, "text": "Okay, I'll leave space for everyone else.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.724, "margin": 0.48, "clean_s": 4.54, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 243.36, "t1": 244.72, "text": "We're running out of blue.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.475, "margin": 0.248, "clean_s": 1.66, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 247.2, "t1": 250.96, "text": "Okay, I'm not going to ask you to guess, I'm going to tell you that's supposed to be a tiger.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.808, "margin": 0.529, "clean_s": 4.06, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 254.64, "t1": 257.68, "text": "and I see them as majestic.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.762, "margin": 0.496, "clean_s": 3.34, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 260.0, "t1": 262.56, "text": "and independent.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.774, "margin": 0.582, "clean_s": 2.86, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 266.32, "t1": 267.12, "text": "and", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.64, "margin": 0.227, "clean_s": 1.1, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 268.8, "t1": 269.44, "text": "proud", "name": "FEE013", "verified": false, "sim": 0.0, "margin": 0.0, "clean_s": 0.94, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 272.4, "t1": 274.88, "text": "Now, who would like to go next?", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.69, "margin": 0.426, "clean_s": 2.78, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 275.28, "t1": 275.84, "text": "Okay.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": false, "sim": 0.0, "margin": 0.0, "clean_s": 0.86, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 275.68, "t1": 276.16, "text": "Okay.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": false, "sim": 0.0, "margin": 0.0, "clean_s": 0.78, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 279.28, "t1": 280.0, "text": "got", "name": "MEO015", "verified": true, "sim": 0.449, "margin": 0.28, "clean_s": 1.02, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 285.28, "t1": 286.88, "text": "Where does this come from?", "name": "MEO015", "verified": true, "sim": 0.595, "margin": 0.526, "clean_s": 1.9, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 287.76, "t1": 288.88, "text": "Put your lapel on.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.599, "margin": 0.301, "clean_s": 1.42, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 290.0, "t1": 290.48, "text": "Yep.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": false, "sim": 0.0, "margin": 0.0, "clean_s": 0.78, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 293.44, "t1": 296.56, "text": "Maybe you can guess what I'm trying to make.", "name": "MEO015", "verified": true, "sim": 0.845, "margin": 0.779, "clean_s": 3.42, "slot_person": "MEO015"}, {"spk": 2, "t0": 306.48, "t1": 307.6, "text": "a kind of dog.", "name": "FEE016", "verified": true, "sim": 0.477, "margin": 0.309, "clean_s": 1.42, "slot_person": "FEE016"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 309.36, "t1": 309.92, "text": "Yep.", "name": "MEO015", "verified": false, "sim": 0.0, "margin": 0.0, "clean_s": 0.86, "slot_person": "MEO015"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 313.6, "t1": 315.68, "text": "It's actually sitting. So.", "name": "MEO015", "verified": true, "sim": 0.647, "margin": 0.458, "clean_s": 2.38, "slot_person": "MEO015"}, {"spk": 2, "t0": 316.08, "t1": 316.72, "text": "Sorry.", "name": "FEE016", "verified": false, "sim": 0.0, "margin": 0.0, "clean_s": 0.94, "slot_person": "FEE016"}, {"spk": 3, "t0": 316.8, "t1": 317.92, "text": "It's sitting down. It's not sitting.", "name": "MEO015", "verified": true, "sim": 0.401, "margin": 0.203, "clean_s": 1.42, "slot_person": "MEO015"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 317.12, "t1": 322.08, "text": "It's sitting, it's not standing. Okay, I see it as one thing. It's very supportive.", "name": "MEO015", "verified": true, "sim": 0.659, "margin": 0.455, "clean_s": 5.26, "slot_person": "MEO015"}, {"spk": 2, "t0": 318.0, "t1": 318.64, "text": "Outstanding.", "name": "FEE016", "verified": false, "sim": 0.0, "margin": 0.0, "clean_s": 0.94, "slot_person": "FEE016"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 324.24, "t1": 332.4, "text": "It's your best friend in your... You can talk to a dog, it can be your best friend, it doesn't discriminate between you based on what you are. Second, it's...", "name": "MEO015", "verified": true, "sim": 0.675, "margin": 0.48, "clean_s": 8.46, "slot_person": "MEO015"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 333.52, "t1": 334.24, "text": "loyal", "name": "MEO015", "verified": false, "sim": 0.361, "margin": 0.198, "clean_s": 1.02, "slot_person": "MEO015"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 335.68, "t1": 338.56, "text": "and third thing it's got intuition", "name": "MEO015", "verified": true, "sim": 0.698, "margin": 0.517, "clean_s": 3.18, "slot_person": "MEO015"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 340.8, "t1": 344.24, "text": "Means dogs can sometimes make out between a thief and a...", "name": "MEO015", "verified": true, "sim": 0.729, "margin": 0.581, "clean_s": 3.74, "slot_person": "MEO015"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 345.28, "t1": 349.68, "text": "So basically these are the three unique features I think belong to a dog.", "name": "MEO015", "verified": true, "sim": 0.668, "margin": 0.409, "clean_s": 4.7, "slot_person": "MEO015"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 350.24, "t1": 351.44, "text": "Okay, thank you.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": true, "sim": 0.426, "margin": 0.354, "clean_s": 1.5, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 3, "t0": 353.84, "t1": 355.12, "text": "Yeah, I hope we go.", "name": "MEO015", "verified": false, "sim": 0.199, "margin": 0.031, "clean_s": 1.58, "slot_person": "MEO015"}, {"spk": 0, "t0": 356.32, "t1": 357.04, "text":