, "clean_s": 1.9, "slot_person": "FEE016"}, {"spk": 3, "t0": 379.76, "t1": 384.72, "text": "Okay, now I'm going to have to change what it was originally going to be because that looks like a beak now.", "name": "MEE014", "verified": true, "sim": 0.959, "margin": 0.736, "clean_s": 5.26, "slot_person": "MEE014"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 382.64, "t1": 383.36, "text": "because that looks like a...", "name": "MEE014", "verified": true, "sim": 0.627, "margin": 0.461, "clean_s": 1.02, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 2, "t0": 391.28, "t1": 392.08, "text": "Crocodile?", "name": "FEE016", "verified": true, "sim": 0.424, "margin": 0.271, "clean_s": 1.1, "slot_person": "FEE016"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 394.08, "t1": 394.72, "text": "Yeah.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": false, "sim": 0.0, "margin": 0.0, "clean_s": 0.94, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 3, "t0": 394.48, "t1": 406.64, "text": "Yeah, it can be a crocodile. It can be a crocodile. Well, firstly, it was an attempt at a T-Rex, and then it sort of changed into a pelican, but it can be a crocodile.", "name": "MEE014", "verified": true, "sim": 0.901, "margin": 0.747, "clean_s": 12.46, "slot_person": "MEE014"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 396.56, "t1": 400.16, "text": "The crocodile. Well, it was... It's going to be a bird. Firstly...", "name": "MEE014", "verified": true, "sim": 0.61, "margin": 0.435, "clean_s": 3.9, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 2, "t0": 403.28, "t1": 403.84, "text": "sort of changed into a...", "name": "FEE016", "verified": false, "sim": 0.0, "margin": 0.0, "clean_s": 0.86, "slot_person": "FEE016"}, {"spk": 1, "t0": 420.24, "t1": 421.36, "text": "That's lovely. Yeah.", "name": "FEE013", "verified": false, "sim": 0.244, "margin": 0.15, "clean_s": 1.42, "slot_person": "FEE013"}, {"spk": 3, "t0": 421.28, "t1": 426.88, "text": "Yeah, and I'll have to think on the spot of things that it is.", "name": "MEE014", "verified": true, "sim": 0.848, "margin": 0.66, "clean_s": 5.9, "slot_person": "MEE014"}, {"spk": 3, "t0": 428.24, "